<h1>Service terms</h1>
<p>The self-service plan is USD $25 per month with recurring billing, one company feed, and an unlimited number of confirmed newsletter recipients. Publishing the public feed, website embed and hosted articles requires 10 confirmed stakeholders from your company. Applicable taxes, if any, are shown at checkout.</p>
<p>You may cancel future renewals through the billing portal. Access continues according to your subscription's paid period.</p>
<p>You must have permission to contact every address you upload or invite, and you are responsible for the lawfulness of the audience you provide. Do not use the service for unlawful outreach or to infringe publisher rights.</p>
<p>Summaries are AI-assisted, may be incomplete or inaccurate, and are not professional advice. Story selection for each recipient is automated. Original content belongs to its respective owners.</p>
<p>Issues on the self-service plan carry Rnews1 advertising, including a sponsored story and a limited number of ad placements. Sponsored content is labelled and is not presented as your editorial. Rnews1 sells and serves this inventory and keeps the revenue from it. Ad-free issues are available on the enterprise plan.</p>
<p>Contact <%= @support_email %> for support and billing questions.</p>
